{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-year-minor-offnet-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.74, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-year-minor-offnet`: `scale-county-timeagg-year`'s Year collapse (January, April, July and October 2020, both day types, all 24 hours, source types 21 and 62, `inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`) on road type 1 alone, selecting `scale-county-minor-offnet`'s species unchanged: the PM species (100, 110, 111, 112, 115, 118, 119, 35, 36, 51-59, 121-124) and the PAH particles (23, 68-78, 81-84) at start exhaust, extended idle, APU, crankcase start and crankcase extended idle (2, 90, 91, 16, 17). MOVESOutput is 17,062 rows, the Hour twin's key set.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is the Hour twin's arithmetic -- SulfatePMCalculator's pmSpeciation outputs, TOM and the residual, its crankcase split onto the crankcase processes from the parent's species, AirToxicsCalculator's PAH particles from organic carbon at the same process -- over PreAggYEAR.sql's month collapse, whose summed FuelSupply SulfatePMCalculator reads as a sum (F69).\n\n`n_aggregatesMonths` is 1; `db_aggregationmonth` and `db_rateday` are read from its XML by `tools/runspec-month-selection.py` and `tools/runspec-day-selection.py`. `n_outputRate` is bound to 17062; `n_physicsRow` 21, the two source types' physics rows.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "start-exhaust",
      "crankcase",
      "pm-speciation",
      "air-toxics",
      "time-aggregation"
    ]
  },
